    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In an inspiring ceremony held on Friday, September 6, 2024, Aga Khan University (AKU) welcomed a fresh cohort of aspiring medical and nursing professionals. The White Coat and Pinning Ceremony, a pivotal milestone in these students' academic journeys, marked the commencement of their rigorous training to become compassionate and skilled healthcare providers.",
